This licence covers the code in code/ and reddit/ and the page scripts. The text
of the page, the figures and the derived data files in data/ are released under
CC BY 4.0, except the Dark Sky Places table (data/dark_sky_places.csv), which is
derived from English Wikipedia and is under CC BY-SA 4.0. Night lights and
population grids derive from WorldPop (CC BY 4.0; lights from the Earth
Observation Group's VIIRS VNL data); sky meter readings are from Globe at Night
(CC BY 4.0). Place names: OS Open Names (Open Government Licence v3) and
GeoNames (CC BY 4.0). Outlines: Natural Earth (public domain) and Office for
National Statistics boundaries (Open Government Licence v3).
